MODULE: CoverageSoundColdCoverageUsesCheckpoint
TARGET: CoverageSound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: cold banking stamps the applied checkpoint rather than the reread frontier
PERTURBS: ReplaySlice
BOUNDS: GapLen = 2

--- FIND
    /\ banked' = [banked EXCEPT ![p] = frontier'[p]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ banked' = [banked EXCEPT ![p] = checkpoint[p]]
--- END
